{"4719630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dream's frog", "steam_appid": 4719630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the enchanting world of dreams with <strong>Dream's Frog</strong>, a charming retro-style arcade puzzle game that tests your logic, memory, and speed. In this game, a cute frog embarks on a journey through mysterious mazes. <br><br>Your goal is to collect all the coins before time runs out. To achieve this, you'll need to open boxes, collect magical items that reveal the contents of the boxes, remember the contents of the boxes, act quickly, strategize, avoid hazards, and utilize power-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As you progress through the levels, the game becomes more challenging, and new items or enemies are introduced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new retro-style adventure game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique graphics, 8-bit music, and sounds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charming main character (Cute, green, and invincible!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of enemies and items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 unique levels (each level introduces new elements)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic timer that keeps you on the edge of your seat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports achievements!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your short-term memory and agility with <strong>Dream’s Frog</strong> !</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the enchanting world of dreams with <strong>Dream's Frog</strong>, a charming retro-style arcade puzzle game that tests your logic, memory, and speed. In this game, a cute frog embarks on a journey through mysterious mazes. <br><br>Your goal is to collect all the coins before time runs out. To achieve this, you'll need to open boxes, collect magical items that reveal the contents of the boxes, remember the contents of the boxes, act quickly, strategize, avoid hazards, and utilize power-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As you progress through the levels, the game becomes more challenging, and new items or enemies are introduced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new retro-style adventure game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique graphics, 8-bit music, and sounds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charming main character (Cute, green, and invincible!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of enemies and items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 unique levels (each level introduces new elements)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic timer that keeps you on the edge of your seat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports achievements!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your short-term memory and agility with <strong>Dream’s Frog</strong> !</p>", "short_description": "Dream's Frog is not just a retro-style arcade puzzle game, but a magical adventure of a cute frog in a dream world where logic, memory, and speed will help you overcome any obstacles. Immerse yourself in the nostalgic atmosphere of the 8-bit era and guide the frog through all 20 mazes!", "supported_languages": "English, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719630/29247bf83aa5c9881cc6130637eede94c932e050/header.jpg?t=1783666637", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719630/c51068aec1f9e84871903492dd61a2021b64d825/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783666637", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719630/c51068aec1f9e84871903492dd61a2021b64d825/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783666637", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\